  "purchaseOrder_ID": "00dad0f5-b30b-5124-b97c-95e4cb0045ea",
  "itemNumber": 90,
  "material_ID": "00a24b8a-d6ef-5fd9-b832-024cf1e9f1b5",
  "quantity": 0,
  "unit": "EA",
  "unitPrice": 25,
  "currency_code": "EUR",
  "deliveryDate": "2026-09-10"
}

### Get a material for testing
GET http://localhost:4004/procurement/Materials?$top=1
Accept: application/json

### Valid PO item - calculate net amount automatically
POST http://localhost:4004/procurement/PurchaseOrderItems
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "purchaseOrder_ID": "00dad0f5-b30b-5124-b97c-95e4cb0045ea",
  "itemNumber": 100,
  "material_ID": "00a24b8a-d6ef-5fd9-b832-024cf1e9f1b5",
  "quantity": 10,
  "unit": "EA",
  "unitPrice": 25,
  "currency_code": "EUR",
  "deliveryDate": "2026-09-10"
}

### Check PO header totals after item creation

GET http://localhost:4004/procurement/PurchaseOrders(00dad0f5-b30b-5124-b97c-95e4cb0045ea)
Accept: application/json